# CleantechHUB — Cursor Rules

You are working on a CleantechHUB project. Follow these guidelines:

## Brand Identity
- Primary color: #0C498A (Deep Blue)
- Secondary: #669348 (Forest Green)
- Accent: #B2EEFA (Light Cyan)
- Full five-color Manual de Marca palette (Jan 2024): see skills/cleantechhub-brand/SKILL.md
- Font: Open Sans / PT Sans (system sans-serif fallback)
- Tone: Expert but accessible, action-oriented, bilingual-ready (EN/ES)
- Always capitalize "CleantechHUB" as one word with capital H-U-B

## Infrastructure Rule
Every long-running service for CleantechHUB deploys to the existing OVH VPS alongside BookStack. Never spin up a new host.

## Key Domains
- cleantechhub.net — Main site (WordPress)
- wiki.cleantechhub.net — Knowledge base (BookStack)
- nexus.cleantechhub.net — Startup portfolio (Static HTML)

## Code Standards
- Use semantic HTML5
- CSS custom properties for brand tokens
- Mobile-first responsive design
- Bilingual support (EN/ES) with language toggle where applicable
- Self-contained HTML files for artifacts (inline CSS/JS)

## Content Standards
- Lead with benefit/impact, not process
- Active voice, short sentences (max 25 words)
- Oxford comma
- Metric units
- Spell out acronyms on first use

## Related Brands
Skills for these brands are in the `skills/` directory:
- CLP26 (ClimateLaunchpad 2026) — green business competition
- Sustenttia — sustainability consulting client
- Diálogos del Futuro — education transformation program
- TecAlianza — technical education initiative

For detailed guidelines, read the SKILL.md files in `skills/*/`.
